{"@context":{"lean":"lean:","block":"block:","imports":{"@type":"@id"}},"@graph":[{"@id":"lean:module:MassTheory.BindingPeriodInvolutionStatistic","@type":"LeanModule","name":"MassTheory.BindingPeriodInvolutionStatistic","imports":["lean:module:Init","lean:module:Mathlib.Algebra.Group.Basic","lean:module:Mathlib.Algebra.Ring.Units","lean:module:Mathlib.Data.Multiset.Basic","lean:module:Mathlib.Tactic.Ring","lean:module:QOU.Mathlib.SchenstedInsertion"],"declarations":17,"chunks":1},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Mass.BindingInvolutionStatistic.statExponents_card","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Mass.BindingInvolutionStatistic.statExponents_card","kind":"theorem","line":197,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/mass-theory/binding-period-involution-statistic.lean#L197-L202","doc":"At `q = 1` the statistic sum counts involutions: sanity anchor tying the\ndecided multisets to the telephone numbers `I(3) = 4`, `I(4) = 10`. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Mass.BindingInvolutionStatistic.binding_period_involution_statistic_five","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Mass.BindingInvolutionStatistic.binding_period_involution_statistic_five","kind":"theorem","line":172,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/mass-theory/binding-period-involution-statistic.lean#L172-L195","doc":"**`n = 5` instance of `prop:binding-period-involution-statistic`**:\n`S^bal(5) = 6 + 2([1]-ish q±) + 3q^{±2} + 2q^{±3} + 3q^{±4}` (the seven partitions\nof 5), and `S^bal(5)·q^{10}` equals the statistic sum over the 26 involutions of `S₅`. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Mass.BindingInvolutionStatistic.statExponents_five","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Mass.BindingInvolutionStatistic.statExponents_five","kind":"theorem","line":165,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/mass-theory/binding-period-involution-statistic.lean#L165-L170","doc":"The 26 involutions of `S₅` carry exponents `{6³,7²,8³,9²,10⁶,11²,12³,13²,14³}`\n(kernel-decided). ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Mass.BindingInvolutionStatistic.binding_period_involution_statistic_four","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Mass.BindingInvolutionStatistic.binding_period_involution_statistic_four","kind":"theorem","line":147,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/mass-theory/binding-period-involution-statistic.lean#L147-L163","doc":"**`n = 4` instance of `prop:binding-period-involution-statistic`**:\n`S^bal(4) = 4 + 3q² + 3q⁻²` (partitions `(4), (1⁴) ↦ 1`, `(3,1), (2,1,1) ↦\n[3] = q² + 1 + q⁻²`, `(2,2) ↦ [4]/[2] = q² + q⁻²`), and `S^bal(4)·q⁶` equals\nthe statistic sum over the ten involutions of `S₄`. ","formalizes":[{"@id":"block:prop:binding-period-involution-statistic","label":"prop:binding-period-involution-statistic","md":"quantum-observable-universe/mass-theory/binding-period-involution-statistic.md"}],"signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Mass.BindingInvolutionStatistic.binding_period_involution_statistic_three","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Mass.BindingInvolutionStatistic.binding_period_involution_statistic_three","kind":"theorem","line":130,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/mass-theory/binding-period-involution-statistic.lean#L130-L145","doc":"**`n = 3` instance of `prop:binding-period-involution-statistic`**:\n`S^bal(3) = 2 + q + q⁻¹` (partitions `(3), (1³) ↦ 1`, `(2,1) ↦ [2] = q + q⁻¹`),\nand `S^bal(3)·q³` equals the statistic sum over the four involutions of `S₃`. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Mass.BindingInvolutionStatistic.inv_mul_val","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Mass.BindingInvolutionStatistic.inv_mul_val","kind":"theorem","line":125,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/mass-theory/binding-period-involution-statistic.lean#L125-L128","doc":"The single algebraic input the three instances need: `q⁻¹ · q = 1` read into\n`R`. This is a **unit** cancellation (`Units.inv_mul`), not a division — which is\nwhy no field appears below. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Mass.BindingInvolutionStatistic.statExponents_four","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Mass.BindingInvolutionStatistic.statExponents_four","kind":"theorem","line":116,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/mass-theory/binding-period-involution-statistic.lean#L116-L119","doc":"The ten involutions of `S₄` carry exponents `{4,4,4, 6,6,6,6, 8,8,8}`\n(kernel-decided). ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Mass.BindingInvolutionStatistic.statExponents_three","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Mass.BindingInvolutionStatistic.statExponents_three","kind":"theorem","line":112,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/mass-theory/binding-period-involution-statistic.lean#L112-L114","doc":"The four involutions of `S₃` carry exponents `{2, 3, 3, 4}` (kernel-decided:\nwords → involution filter → maj → RSK shape → content). ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Mass.BindingInvolutionStatistic.statExponents","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Mass.BindingInvolutionStatistic.statExponents","kind":"def","line":106,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/mass-theory/binding-period-involution-statistic.lean#L106-L110","doc":"The involution-statistic exponent multiset at level `n`:\n`{2·maj(w) + content(λ(w)) : w ∈ Inv(Sₙ)}`. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Mass.BindingInvolutionStatistic.shapeContent","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Mass.BindingInvolutionStatistic.shapeContent","kind":"def","line":98,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/mass-theory/binding-period-involution-statistic.lean#L98-L104","doc":"Content of a shape `λ` (row lengths, top row first):\n`Σ_{(i,j)∈λ} (j − i) = Σ_i (λᵢ(λᵢ−1)/2 − i·λᵢ)`, 0-based `i, j`. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Mass.BindingInvolutionStatistic.shape","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Mass.BindingInvolutionStatistic.shape","kind":"def","line":95,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/mass-theory/binding-period-involution-statistic.lean#L95-L96","doc":"RSK shape of a word: row lengths of its Schensted insertion tableau. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Mass.BindingInvolutionStatistic.majW","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Mass.BindingInvolutionStatistic.majW","kind":"def","line":90,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/mass-theory/binding-period-involution-statistic.lean#L90-L93","doc":"Major index of a word: the sum of the (1-based) descent positions. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Mass.BindingInvolutionStatistic.isInvolution","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Mass.BindingInvolutionStatistic.isInvolution","kind":"def","line":86,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/mass-theory/binding-period-involution-statistic.lean#L86-L88","doc":"`w` is an involution: `w(w(i)) = i` at every position (1-based letters). ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Mass.BindingInvolutionStatistic.words","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Mass.BindingInvolutionStatistic.words","kind":"def","line":83,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/mass-theory/binding-period-involution-statistic.lean#L83-L84","doc":"All one-line words of `Sₙ` on the letters `1..n`. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Mass.BindingInvolutionStatistic.upTo","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Mass.BindingInvolutionStatistic.upTo","kind":"def","line":78,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/mass-theory/binding-period-involution-statistic.lean#L78-L81","doc":"The word `[1, …, n]` (structural). ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Mass.BindingInvolutionStatistic.perms","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Mass.BindingInvolutionStatistic.perms","kind":"def","line":73,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/mass-theory/binding-period-involution-statistic.lean#L73-L76","doc":"All permutations of a word, by successive insertion (structural). ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Mass.BindingInvolutionStatistic.insertAll","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Mass.BindingInvolutionStatistic.insertAll","kind":"def","line":66,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/mass-theory/binding-period-involution-statistic.lean#L66-L71","doc":"Insert `x` into every position of a word (structural recursion, so the\nkernel can evaluate it inside `decide` — `List.permutations` is well-founded-\nrecursive and does not kernel-reduce). ","signatureChunk":0}]}